      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "7C9CA8CA2AD22CBC",
      "text": "Du erhältst [VAR 0x0204(0001,202F)] BP von der Lehrerin!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "0204",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "202F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "EB837EC0B45CBB4B",
      "text": "Ah, [VAR 0x1100(00FF,1614,0000)]der Austauschschülerdie Austauschschülerin! Hallo, ich bin hier\\nBeratungslehrerin.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "1614",
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "EB837FC0B45CBCFE",
      "text": "Das kommt jetzt etwas plötzlich, aber bestreitest\\ndu fleißig Pokémon-Kämpfe?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "EB8380C0B45CBEB1",
      "text": "Hier an der Blaubeer-Akademie wollen wir die\\nSchüler dazu ermutigen, Pokémon-Kämpfe\\r\\ngegeneinander auszutragen.\\c\\nDeswegen schenken wir ihnen umso mehr BP,\\nje mehr Kämpfe sie in der Kuppel bestreiten.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_04a",
      "hash64": "8D357F72799A487F",
      "text": "Versuch doch erst mal, gegen [VAR 0x0201(0002)] Schüler im\\nSavannen-Areal zu gewinnen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_04b",
      "hash64": "8D358072799A4A32",
      "text": "Versuch doch erst mal, gegen [VAR 0x0201(0002)] Schüler im\\nCanyon-Areal zu gewinnen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_04c",
      "hash64": "8D358172799A4BE5",
      "text": "Versuch doch erst mal, gegen [VAR 0x0201(0002)] Schüler im\\nKüsten-Areal zu gewinnen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
